08.8, "y": 280.2, "width": 619.5, "height": 18.899999999999977}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MM, multiple myeloma; CML, chronic myeloid leukemia; CLL, chronic lymphocytic", "bbox": {"x": 886.7, "y": 255.0, "width": 641.5, "height": 18.899999999999977}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "eukemia; CsA, cyclosporine; MTX, methotrexate; Tac, tacrolimus; Sir, sirolimus;", "bbox": {"x": 908.8, "y": 229.8, "width": 616.3, "height": 18.900000000000006}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "TCY, posttransplant cyclophosphamide; RIC, reduced intensity conditioning; MAC,", "bbox": {"x": 877.3, "y": 204.6, "width": 647.8, "height": 22.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "myeloablative conditioning; aGHD, acute graft-versus-host disease.", "bbox": {"x": 993.7, "y": 179.5, "width": 534.6000000000001, "height": 22.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Frontiers in Immunology | www.frontiersin.org|", "bbox": {"x": 1150.7, "y": 81.7, "width": 374.5, "height": 25.10000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Flow and Mass Cytometry in cGVHD", "bbox": {"x": 125.8, "y": 2065.3, "width": 308.2, "height": 22.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "restrictions, it was not possible to analyze all patients for all", "bbox": {"x": 122.6, "y": 1964.5, "width": 682.4, "height": 28.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "methods, a selection based on sample availability was made. In", "bbox": {"x": 122.6, "y": 1933.0, "width": 682.4, "height": 28.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "addition, it was unfortunately not possible to compare the findings", "bbox": {"x": 122.6, "y": 1901.5, "width": 682.4, "height": 28.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "from this study with the immune phenotype of the patients before", "bbox": {"x": 119.5, "y": 1866.9, "width": 685.5, "height": 34.59999999999991}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "GVHD was diagnosed. The study was approved by the Regional", "bbox": {"x": 119.5, "y": 1835.4, "width": 685.5, "height": 31.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Ethical Review Board in Stockholm, Sweden (DNR 2007/1349-31", "bbox": {"x": 119.5, "y": 1807.1, "width": 682.4, "height": 28.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "and DNR 2006/1433-31/3). All patients gave written informed", "bbox": {"x": 122.6, "y": 1772.5, "width": 682.4, "height": 28.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "consent in accordance with the amended Declaration of Helsinki.", "bbox": {"x": 125.8, "y": 1747.3, "width": 679.2, "height": 22.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Sample Preparation", "bbox": {"x": 484.3, "y": 1687.5, "width": 317.6000000000001, "height": 31.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Plasma was separated from whole blood samples and stored", "bbox": {"x": 122.6, "y": 1652.8, "width": 679.2, "height": 25.200000000000045}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "at -80°C. Peripheral blood mononuclear blood cells (PBMCs)", "bbox": {"x": 125.8, "y": 1621.4, "width": 679.2, "height": 25.200000000000045}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "were separated by density gradient centrifugation [800 × g,", "bbox": {"x": 125.8, "y": 1586.7, "width": 676.1, "height": 28.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "20 min; Lymphoprep (Fresenius Kabi, Oslo, Norway)] and fro-", "bbox": {"x": 122.6, "y": 1555.2, "width": 679.2, "height": 31.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "zen at -196°C in 10% DMSO in complete RPMI-1640 medium", "bbox": {"x": 125.8, "y": 1523.8, "width": 679.2, "height": 28.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "TABLE 2 | The patient characteristics of the 37 patients who were analyzed in", "bbox": {"x": 150.9, "y": 1429.3, "width": 654.1, "height": 22.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "the confirmatory flow cytometry study (Figure 5).", "bbox": {"x": 389.9, "y": 1401.0, "width": 415.1, "height": 22.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "cGVHD", "bbox": {"x": 732.5, "y": 1356.2, "width": 69.5, "height": 20.200000000000045}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "None", "bbox": {"x": 503.1, "y": 1356.9, "width": 56.60000000000002, "height": 22.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Mild", "bbox": {"x": 386.8, "y": 1356.9, 